/t.co/V6KST1MrMt"}]}, "id": "2115755873968504926", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 6, "impression_count": 3813, "like_count": 9, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 2}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115754766009565222", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Ten alternate Central Committee members—Lu Dongliang, Bao Gang, Xing Shanping, Qu Yingpu, Lü Jun, Zhu Tianshu, Zhu Guoxian, Liu Jun, Liu Jie and Liu Qiang—were elevated to full membership. Five higher-ranked alternates were passed over: Fu Wenhua, Cong Liang, Jilin, Zhu Wenxiang https://t.co/V6KST1MrMt", "url": "https://x.com/niubi/status/2115755873968504926"}, {"author_id": "3512101", "created_at": "2026-10-29T10:36:59.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115754766009565222"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/RHZUY6gMKy", "end": 298, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/niubi/status/2115754766009565222/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2115754762440192000", "start": 275, "url": "https://t.co/RHZUY6gMKy"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/RHZUY6gMKy", "end": 298, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/niubi/status/2115754766009565222/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2115754762394128384", "start": 275, "url": "https://t.co/RHZUY6gMKy"}]}, "id": "2115754766009565222", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 23, "impression_count": 46068, "like_count": 39, "quote_count": 6, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 15}, "text": "5th plenum communique out. Zhang Shengmin added to politburo, first addition of a new pb member at a plenum in 32 years, announced 21st party congress will meet in 2H 2027, lots of cases handled. And no let up in pressure on cadres and corruption and ideological discipline. https://t.co/RHZUY6gMKy", "url": "https://x.com/niubi/status/2115754766009565222"}, {"author_id": "3512101", "created_at": "2026-10-29T09:50:36.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115743093454704963"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/niubi/status/2…", "end": 109, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/niubi/status/2115530994551758868", "start": 86, "url": "https://t.co/lxhDyswNia"}]}, "id": "2115743093454704963", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 13, "impression_count": 4269, "like_count": 42, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 10}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115530994551758868", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "This post about foreign influencers in china is a must read, now outside the paywall. https://t.co/lxhDyswNia", "url": "https://x.com/niubi/status/2115743093454704963"}, {"author_id": "423769635", "created_at": "2026-10-29T09:46:39.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115742097492123811"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "Explore this post and more from the dataisbeautiful community", "display_url": "reddit.com/r/dataisbeauti…", "end": 114, "expanded_url": "https://www.reddit.com/r/dataisbeautiful/comments/1xdj6k5/oc_years_of_fulltime_pay_needed_to_buy_a_typical/", "images": [{"height": 584, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2114326292464041984/vVGs1gli?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1120}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2114326292464041984/vVGs1gli?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 91, "status": 200, "title": "From the dataisbeautiful community on Reddit: [OC] Years of full-time pay needed to buy a typical home in Hong Kong, Taiwan, Canada, Australia, the UK and the US, 1985-2025", "unwound_url": "https://www.reddit.com/r/dataisbeautiful/comments/1xdj6k5/oc_years_of_fulltime_pay_needed_to_buy_a_typical/", "url": "https://t.co/VHEF8JeXIZ"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/TYpmtJG5xc", "end": 138, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/SoberLook/status/2115742097492123811/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2115742015853834240", "start": 115, "url": "https://t.co/TYpmtJG5xc"}]}, "id": "2115742097492123811", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 10, "impression_count": 9124, "like_count": 24, "quote_count": 2, "reply_count": 6, "retweet_count": 7}, "text": "Around the world, it now takes more years of full-time pay to buy a typical home.\n\nSource: https://t.co/VHEF8JeXIZ https://t.co/TYpmtJG5xc", "url": "https://x.com/SoberLook/status/2115742097492123811"}, {"author_id": "1327359720", "created_at": "2026-10-29T09:40:43.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115740606479942110"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/IeV9Viy1V8", "end": 287, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/lisaabramowicz1/status/2115740606479942110/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2115740105990119424", "start": 264, "url": "https://t.co/IeV9Viy1V8"}]}, "id": "2115740606479942110", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 53, "impression_count": 26291, "like_count": 371, "quote_count": 14, "reply_count": 55, "retweet_count": 87}, "text": "Follow the free cash flow.....so far, tech companies that are maintaining positive free cash flow are being rewarded. Those that aren't are being punished. If today's premarket losses hold, Alphabet is poised to lose $397.6 billion of market valuation in one day. https://t.co/IeV9Viy1V8", "url": "https://x.com/lisaabramowicz1/status/2115740606479942110"}, {"author_id": "917683048782503937", "created_at": "2026-10-29T07:19:20.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115705025909645782"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "Cuauhtémoc Cárdenas Solórzano, a towering figure of the Mexican left whose challenge to a once long-ruling party helped propel the country toward democracy, has died. He was 92.", "display_url": "bloomberg.com/news/articles/…", "end": 137, "expanded_url": "https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-10-29/cuauhtemoc-cardenas-key-figure-in-mexican-democracy-dies-at-92?utm_source=website&utm_medium=share&utm_campaign=twitter", "images": [{"height": 800, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2115701247164792832/zWiV1JQi?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1200}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2115701247164792832/zWiV1JQi?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 114, "status": 200, "title": "Cuauhtémoc Cárdenas, Key Figure in Mexican Democracy, Dies at 92", "unwound_url": "https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-10-29/cuauhtemoc-cardenas-key-figure-in-mexican-democracy-dies-at-92?utm_source=website&utm_medium=share&utm_campaign=twitter", "url": "https://t.co/D9squC45F4"}]}, "id": "2115705025909645782", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 3, "impression_count": 6640, "like_count": 19, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 3}, "text": "Sorry to hear that Cuauhtémoc Cárdenas has died. I remember following his run for president in 1988 very closely. https://t.co/D9squC45F4", "url": "https://x.com/michaelxpettis/status/2115705025909645782"}, {"author_id": "917683048782503937", "created_at": "2026-10-29T07:08:53.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115702395866927213"], "id": "2115702395866927213", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 17, "impression_count": 13854, "like_count": 81, "quote_count": 5, "reply_count": 14, "retweet_count": 13}, "text": "According to SCMP, workers in China’s non-private sector earned 80% more on average, and saw income grow by 4% year on year, than the average wage in the private sector, where income grew 3% year on year. The private sector has accounted for 80 per cent of urban jobs despite", "url": "https://x.com/michaelxpettis/status/2115702395866927213"}, {"author_id": "917683048782503937", "created_at": "2026-10-29T07:01:43.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115700590344823283"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "Chinese airlines cut back the most as tensions that began almost a year ago continue to depress tourism.", "display_url": "scmp.com/economy/articl…", "end": 267, "expanded_url": "https://www.scmp.com/economy/article/3372534/china-japan-flights-drop-nearly-700000-seats-amid-political-spat?module=top_story&pgtype=section", "images": [{"height": 630, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2115700590990737408/ys8ZCkTJ?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1200}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2115700590990737408/ys8ZCkTJ?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 244, "status": 200, "title": "China-Japan flights lose nearly 700,000 seats amid political spat", "unwound_url": "https://www.scmp.com/economy/article/3372534/china-japan-flights-drop-nearly-700000-seats-amid-political-spat?module=top_story&pgtype=section", "url": "https://t.co/ZvS2rmj8aG"}]}, "id": "2115700590344823283", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 7231, "like_count": 41, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 9}, "text": "SCMP: \"Airlines will cut nearly 700,000 seats from their China-Japan flights and axe more than 5,000 flights for the coming winter travel season as a nearly year-old political squabble continues to depress tourism, according to aviation data.\"\nhttps://t.co/ZvS2rmj8aG", "url": "https://x.com/michaelxpettis/status/2115700590344823283"}, {"author_id": "917683048782503937", "created_at": "2026-10-29T06:56:16.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115699219931525502"], "id": "2115699219931525502", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 8, "impression_count": 9243, "like_count": 48, "quote_count": 2, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 8}, "text": "Caixin: \"China’s three state policy banks have completed the deployment of 800 billion yuan through new policy-financing instruments for 2026, with substantial allocations to emerging industries and projects involving private investment. The state-backed funding is part of", "url": "https://x.com/michaelxpettis/status/2115699219931525502"}, {"author_id": "917683048782503937", "created_at": "2026-10-29T06:54:02.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115698656481284581"], "id": "2115698656481284581", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 3, "impression_count": 6234, "like_count": 17, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 6}, "text": "Caixin: \"The divergence between robust financial performance and falling valuations reflects broader market jitters over the return on investment in AI infrastructure, which has triggered a sel